Khosro (Hosrov) Sheikh Harandi was the first Iranian chess International Master and 3-time Iran chess champion. He was a member of the national team in five Chess Olympiads.In 1970, at fourth board in 19th Chess Olympiad in Siegen ;
In 1972, at first board in 20th Chess Olympiad in Skopje ;
In 1974, at first board in 21st Chess Olympiad in Nice ;
In 1976, at second board in 22nd Chess Olympiad in Haifa ;
In 1990, at first board in 29th Chess Olympiad in Novi Sad.
